    given-names: Andrew
    alias: Bortlesboat
date-released: 2026-09-25
license: MIT
url: "https://github.com/Bortlesboat/Bortlesboat/tree/main/bitcoin-research/experiments/shielded-publication"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Bortlesboat/Bortlesboat"
abstract: >-
  A controlled Bitcoin Core regtest experiment comparing carrier retry policies
  and shared-anchor spacing under a height-only model of the Shielded Bitcoin
  paper. Includes 24 cases, boundary and relay controls, raw traces and tests.
  Payloads are synthetic; no Shielded proof or complete transfer is verified.
